\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Example}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{#{g} is not onto. There are many, many elements of the domain (that is, natural numbers) which are not the output of #{g} for any input. There is no function with the same domain and codomain we could make that would be onto—the domain is too small to cover everything in the codomain!}

